      "message": "I\u0027ve added a flag and  flagged the API. Can you provide me some pointers on how this FlaggedApi works so that I can figure out what all usages of this API need to be flag guarded?\n\nI couldn\u0027t find any examples to answer the same (not even at go/android-flags-howto-apis#new-apis-in-mainline-code). Some of the questions I had are:\n\n1. How do I flag guard the usage of this field in Metadata.java? \n2. Do I even flag guard such usage in the bt service? \n3. Do I flag guard the METADATA_MAX_KEY in BluetoothDevice? \n4. How does the client check if this API is available? etc.",
